…-   포인트: 주문 저장 + Outbox 저장을 같은 @Transactional 안에서 커밋 → 일관성 확보.

```java
@Service
public class OrderService {
  private final OrderRepository orderRepo;
  private final OrderItemRepository itemRepo;
  private final OutboxEventRepository outboxRepo;
  private final ObjectMapper om;

  @Transactional
  public Long createOrder(CreateOrderCommand cmd) throws JsonProcessingException {
    Order order = new Order();
    order.setCustomerId(cmd.customerId());
    order.setTotalAmount(cmd.totalAmount());
    order = orderRepo.save(order);

    for (CreateOrderItem i : cmd.items()) {
      OrderItem item = new OrderItem();
      item.setOrderId(order.getId());
      item.setProductId(i.productId());
      item.setQuantity(i.quantity());
      item.setPrice(i.price());
      itemRepo.save(item);
    }

    // Outbox 이벤트 작성 (ORDER_CREATED)
    var event = new HashMap<String,Object>();
    event.put("eventId", UUID.randomUUID().toString());
    event.put("type", "ORDER_CREATED");
    event.put("orderId", order.getId());
    event.put("customerId", order.getCustomerId());
    event.put("items", cmd.items()); // productId, quantity 포함

    OutboxEvent outbox = new OutboxEvent();
    outbox.setAggregateType("ORDER");
    outbox.setAggregateId(order.getId().toString());
    outbox.setType("ORDER_CREATED");
    outbox.setPayload(om.writeValueAsString(event));
    outboxRepo.save(outbox);

    return order.getId();
  }
}
```

