**[Outbox Processor (@Scheduled → Kafka 발행)]**

```java
@Component
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class OutboxProcessor {

  private final OutboxEventRepository outboxRepo;
  private final KafkaTemplate<String, String> kafkaTemplate;

  @Scheduled(fixedDelayString = "PT5S") // 5초마다 배치
  @Transactional
  public void publishPending() {
    List<OutboxEvent> batch = outboxRepo.findTop100ByStatusOrderByCreatedAtAsc("PENDING");

    for (OutboxEvent e : batch) {
      try {
        e.setStatus("SENDING");
        outboxRepo.save(e);

        // key: aggregateId(예: orderId) → 파티션 키 안정화
        kafkaTemplate.send("order.events", e.getAggregateId(), e.getPayload()).get();

        e.setStatus("SENT");
        outboxRepo.save(e);
      } catch (Exception ex) {
        e.setStatus("FAILED");
        outboxRepo.save(e);
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**[Kafka Streams 앱 (order.events → product.counts)]**

-   목적: 주문 이벤트에서 상품별 주문수/수량을 집계해 카프카 토픽(product.counts)으로 내보냄.
    Redis 업데이트는 뒤의 컨슈머가 담당(ZINCRBY).

